260
00:15:35,250 --> 00:15:36,500
Maaf, apa?

261
00:15:38,291 --> 00:15:39,166
Marco Moretti?

262
00:15:40,833 --> 00:15:42,875
Kok dia ada dalam percakapan ini?

263
00:15:43,541 --> 00:15:45,165
Kita harus bicara dengannya.

264
00:15:45,166 --> 00:15:46,582
Justru kami bicara denganmu

265
