40 sialan apa, Cico?

282
00:16:35,208 --> 00:16:37,707
Tentu saja 40 juta euro.

283
00:16:37,708 --> 00:16:40,290
- Oke, sudah cukup.
- Oke, tunggu.

284
00:16:40,291 --> 00:16:41,915
Oke. Baiklah.

285
